     9632                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     9633   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('obj-type*obj-code', 'Объект', 'cli',
     9634                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     9635   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('boss', 'Менеджер', 'cli',
