     9682                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     9683   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('ship-date', 'Дата отгрузки', '',
     9684                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
