     9686                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     9687   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('tot-ov', 'Сумма акта', '',
     9688                                       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
